Notebook[{
Cell["InfraLine", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"b94c2b25-97c1-4b4e-8171-ab4a851dc8a7"],

Cell["[LLM Generated]", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"71e3343e-1510-48e2-a2b6-b0985a61852f"],

Cell["\<\
InfraLine[p, q] represents maximal geodesic extensions through p and q. \
InfraLine[path] extends a given path. Multi-realisations are returned as \
InfraSegment[{...}] (the only path-shaped wrapper).\
